 "provisional": [
  "MPlaneDiveBomber 12h, MPlaneTorpedoBomber 11h, MPlaneKamikaze 17h: the set is certain, the assignment within it rests on a per-record creator offset of 298h in the three large plane descriptors at 00D19C98..00D1A520.",
  "4Eh is carried by two class tests 004351E0 and 00435360 with two vtables 00CE3E60 and 00CE3FD0; one class with two vtables or two classes sharing an id was not decided.",
  "MKamikazePlane (00CFA4A0) and MArtilleryBullet (00CFA464) were not paired with an id."
 ],
 "tool_problems": [
  "bsp.py ledger add-name --append-evidence also updates the name when it differs, so a second pass over addresses that already succeeded both duplicated their evidence text and renamed eight records another packet owned. The duplicate segments were removed and one name (0074E400, BSP_PlaneInstance_IsKindOf) was restored.",
  "ghidra xrefs under-reports immediate operands, so the 92 +C4h stamps, the 87 class tests and the vtable slot 5Ch pointers were all found by scanning the PE directly with capstone."
 ]
